          "author": "J.J. Heller",
          "description": "Here are the melodies that bring a smile to the young and the young-at-heart. I Dream of You: PLAY is a joyful soundtrack for silly moments and everyday magic. With familiar stories and heartwarming melodies, JJ Heller’s vocals summon both childlike enthusiasm and a mother’s love. So hum along, dance, giggle, and dream… it’s a perfect day for unhurried free time, a singalong in the car, or turning any room into your own stage. This album brings joy wherever it goes. Just press play, and play!",
